      "eventType": "verification.verdict.approved",
      "producer": "verifier approve verdict",
      "producerFiles": [
        "backend/internal/verification/adapters/postgres/repository.go"
      ],
      "consumers": [
        {
          "module": "notification",
          "file": "backend/internal/notificationbridge/verification_notify_consumer.go"
        },
        {
          "module": "counts",
          "file": "backend/internal/counts/app/shifting_verification_handler.go",
          "notes": "ShiftingVerificationHandler.HandleEvent filters source.module=counts + source.ref_type=shifting_event and calls Repository.ApplyVerifiedShiftingEvent (legacy method name), which marks verification_state='verified' only. Under the maintainer-2026-07-28 rule, Park Head approval + operator completion already own relocation/count; verifier approval cannot move or roll back census truth. A pre-000049 authorized+completed row may be lazily applied once for rollout compatibility."
        },
        {
          "module": "feeddirection",
          "file": "backend/internal/feeddirection/app/feed_distribution_verification_handler.go",
          "notes": "FeedDistributionVerificationHandler.HandleEvent filters source.module=feed + source.ref_type=feed_distribution_completion and calls DistributionCompletionStore.ApplyVerifiedDistribution, which flips the feed_distribution_completions row 'pending_verification' -> 'completed' and emits feed.distribution.completed. Maintainer-2026-07-26 gate: a feed-direction session is completed only when a verifier approves the operator's video + water proof. Separate NEW table; the old instant feed_direction_session_completions / feed.direction.completed path is inert."
        },
        {
          "module": "feeddirection",
          "file": "backend/internal/feeddirection/app/feed_packing_verification_handler.go",
          "notes": "FeedPackingVerificationHandler.HandleEvent filters source.module=feed + source.ref_type=feed_packing_completion (distinct from the distribution handler, which shares module=feed but uses ref_type=feed_distribution_completion) and calls PackingCompletionStore.ApplyVerifiedPacking, which flips the feed_packing_completions row 'pending_verification' -> 'completed' and emits feed.packing.completed. Maintainer-2026-07-26 gate (SUPERSEDING the earlier 'packing stays instant' rule): a feed PACKING session is completed only when a verifier approves the operator's ONE mandatory packing video. Separate NEW table."
        },
        {
          "module": "tasks",
          "file": "backend/internal/tasks/app/event_handlers.go",
          "notes": "DeathVerificationHandler filters source.module=counts + ref_type=workflow_death_signoff and closes the death review gate. BirthVerificationHandler filters ref_type=workflow_birth_signoff, whose ref_id is one mother or child workflow_id, and closes only that subject's gate. Death carries two proofs; each Birth item carries only its workflow's task-proof bundle. Keys include workflow, review round, and proof refs so retries deduplicate and re-shoots create a fresh item."
        }
      ],
      "owningDoc": "context/architecture/verifier-app-and-flow.md",
      "e2eProof": [
        "backend/internal/verification/app/service_test.go",
        "backend/internal/notificationbridge/verification_notify_consumer_test.go",
